  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> are the events that the examinee guesses, copies and knows the answer and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math> is the event that he answers correctly.<br /><br />Then, <math> <mrow> <mtext>P</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>,</mtext>&nbsp; &nbsp;<mtext>P</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br />and <math> <mrow> <mtext>P</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><mo>∴</mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Required probability = <math> <mrow> <mtext>P</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>E</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>P</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtex